{
  "modName": "SimpleAimAssist",
  "displayName": "简单辅助瞄准",
  "minMcmVersion": 1,
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "section",
      "text": "状态"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "辅助瞄准跟随游戏实际瞄准状态；近战使用实际格挡状态。"
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "pageDisplayName": "基础设置",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "辅助瞄准"
        },
        {
          "id": "bEnabled:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "启用辅助瞄准",
          "help": "枪械进入实际瞄准状态、近战进入实际格挡状态时，辅助瞄准会生效。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": true
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetEnabled",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "iInputMode:Main",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "text": "输入设备",
          "help": "键鼠或手柄模式只接受所选设备；键鼠共存模式根据最近一次输入设备自动切换参数。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingInt",
            "default": 1,
            "options": [
              "键盘 / 鼠标",
              "手柄",
              "键鼠共存（自动切换）"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetInputMode",
            "params": [
              "{i}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fAssistStrengthScale:Main",
          "type": "slider",
          "text": "吸附强度",
          "help": "控制准星靠近并跟随锁定目标的速度。范围为 0.1-1.0。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingFloat",
            "default": 0.5,
            "min": 0.1,
            "max": 1.0,
            "step": 0.05
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetAssistStrengthScale",
            "params": [
              "{f}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "bAllowHighZoom:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "高倍镜也启用辅助瞄准",
          "help": "开启后不再因为画面放大而跳过辅助瞄准。高倍镜下锁定范围和命中部位仍由游戏画面决定。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": false
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetAllowHighZoom",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "iManualAimReturnDelay:Main",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "text": "回锚点等待",
          "help": "停止移动准星后，等待一段时间再回到默认锚点。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingInt",
            "default": 1,
            "options": [
              "不等待",
              "短等待（180毫秒）",
              "长等待（350毫秒）"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetManualAimReturnDelay",
            "params": [
              "{i}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "bEnableCrosshairTracking:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "持续准星追踪",
          "help": "开启时持续跟随锁定目标；关闭后普通辅助只在首次获得目标时进行一次校正，独立锁定不受影响。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": true
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetCrosshairTrackingEnabled",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "目标标记"
        },
        {
          "id": "bEnableTargetMarker:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "显示目标标记",
          "help": "锁定目标时，在目标头顶显示独立标记。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": true
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetTargetMarkerEnabled",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "iTargetMarkerStyle:Main",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "text": "标记款式",
          "help": "选择锁定目标头顶显示的标记样式。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingInt",
            "default": 5,
            "options": [
              "红三角",
              "纯白",
              "白红",
              "红翼",
              "青双V",
              "威胁骷髅"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetTargetMarkerStyle",
            "params": [
              "{i}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "锁定行为"
        },
        {
          "id": "bNoFireTimeoutAffectsIndependentLock:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "独立锁定受无操作退出影响",
          "help": "开启后，独立锁定也会在无开枪或无准星操作达到上方时间后退出。默认关闭，适合近战接近目标。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": false
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetNoFireTimeoutAffectsIndependentLock",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "说明：独立开关模式受此开关影响，默认关闭。"
        },
        {
          "id": "bAllowOutOfCombatHostileTargets:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "允许锁定未进入战斗的敌人",
          "help": "实验功能。开启后，只要目标仍对玩家敌对，即使尚未进入战斗也可以锁定。敌对关系、距离、视线和准星范围限制仍然有效。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": false
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetAllowOutOfCombatHostileTargets",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "说明：实验功能，尚未充分验证。普通瞄准和独立锁定都会受此开关影响。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pageDisplayName": "独立锁定",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "功能设置"
        },
        {
          "id": "bToggleAimMode:Main",
          "type": "switcher",
          "text": "启用独立锁定功能",
          "help": "默认关闭。开启后，短按右摇杆锁定或取消目标，长按执行下方选择的固定动作。关闭后右摇杆恢复游戏原本的行为。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingBool",
            "default": false
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetToggleAimMode",
            "params": [
              "{b}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "iGamepadLongPressAction:Main",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "text": "长按右摇杆动作",
          "help": "独立锁定开启时，长按右摇杆将执行这里选择的固定动作；可以选择潜行或切换第一/第三人称。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingInt",
            "default": 0,
            "options": [
              "潜行",
              "切换第一/第三人称"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetGamepadLongPressAction",
            "params": [
              "{i}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "SAA_TargetLockHotkey",
          "type": "hotkey",
          "text": "锁定目标按键",
          "help": "键鼠路径没有默认按键。请在这里绑定自定义按键；手柄纯模式会忽略此键，键鼠共存模式仍可使用。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "allowModifierKeys": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "操作说明"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "手柄操作：短按右摇杆锁定或取消目标；长按超过 0.25 秒执行上方选择的固定动作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "键鼠操作：需要在上方设置自定义锁定按键；未设置时不会占用鼠标中键。手柄纯模式不处理这个键。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "锁定效果：无需保持瞄准或格挡。远程准星持续跟随目标，近战持续面朝目标。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "结束条件：目标失效后只重新搜索一次；找不到其他敌人便结束，需要再次按键。"
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "兼容说明"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "关闭独立锁定后，右摇杆恢复游戏原本的行为；开启后，手柄可用右摇杆短按锁定或取消，键鼠可用自定义按键。手柄纯模式忽略键鼠热键，键鼠共存模式两种路径都可用。普通瞄准与格挡辅助不受影响，独立锁定可与 Toggle Aim 类模组同时使用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pageDisplayName": "锁定参数",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "瞄准锚点"
        },
        {
          "id": "iAimAnchor:Main",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "text": "默认锁定部位",
          "help": "选择辅助瞄准默认跟随的部位。特殊生物缺少对应节点时会自动回退到身体。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingInt",
            "default": 0,
            "options": [
              "身体",
              "头部",
              "下半身"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetAimAnchor",
            "params": [
              "{i}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "快捷操作"
        },
        {
          "id": "SAA_CycleAimAnchorHotkey",
          "type": "hotkey",
          "text": "快速切换锚点",
          "help": "按一次按身体、头部、下半身的顺序循环切换；默认不绑定。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "allowModifierKeys": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "武器距离"
        },
        {
          "id": "fMeleeLockDistance:Main",
          "type": "slider",
          "text": "近战锁定距离",
          "help": "近战武器不受最低距离限制，并使用独立的最大锁定距离。默认值为 900。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingFloat",
            "default": 900.0,
            "min": 100.0,
            "max": 3000.0,
            "step": 50.0
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetMeleeLockDistance",
            "params": [
              "{f}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fRangedLockDistance:Main",
          "type": "slider",
          "text": "远程锁定距离",
          "help": "枪械、弓、投掷物等远程武器使用的最大锁定距离。默认值保持当前远程行为。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingFloat",
            "default": 2400.0,
            "min": 500.0,
            "max": 10000.0,
            "step": 250.0
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetRangedLockDistance",
            "params": [
              "{f}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "目标选择"
        },
        {
          "id": "iTargetSwitchLevel:Main",
          "type": "dropdown",
          "text": "切换目标力度",
          "help": "锁定时大幅移动右摇杆或拖动鼠标，可以切换到准星附近的其他敌人。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingInt",
            "default": 2,
            "options": [
              "关闭",
              "大幅移动",
              "中等移动",
              "小幅移动",
              "很小幅移动"
            ]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetTargetSwitchLevel",
            "params": [
              "{i}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fSearchConeDegrees:Main",
          "type": "slider",
          "text": "吸附范围",
          "help": "控制敌人需要多靠近准星才会被初次锁定。数值越低越精确。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingFloat",
            "default": 14.0,
            "min": 3.0,
            "max": 24.0,
            "step": 1.0
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetSearchConeDegrees",
            "params": [
              "{f}{value}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fNoFireTimeoutSeconds:Main",
          "type": "slider",
          "text": "无操作自动退出时间",
          "help": "锁定后没有开枪或移动准星时，经过指定时间自动退出。默认关闭，设为 0 可关闭。独立锁定是否受影响请在基础设置的锁定行为中单独设置。",
          "valueOptions": {
            "sourceType": "ModSettingFloat",
            "default": 0.0,
            "min": 0.0,
            "max": 15.0,
            "step": 0.5
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "CallGlobalFunction",
            "script": "SimpleAimAssist",
            "function": "OnMcmSetNoFireTimeoutSeconds",
            "params": [
              "{f}{value}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pageDisplayName": "使用说明",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "普通辅助瞄准"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "远程在瞄准时生效，近战在格挡时生效；状态结束后立即停止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "独立锁定"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "按独立按键索敌。锁定后无需保持瞄准或格挡；远程准星持续跟随目标，近战持续面朝目标。"
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "目标与标记"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "目标失效后只重新搜索一次，找不到便结束。标记始终位于目标头顶；瞄准锚点可在“锁定参数”中选择。"
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "text": "兼容与限制"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "普通辅助读取游戏实际状态，可配合 Toggle Aim。高倍镜限制可在“基础设置”中关闭。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
